stereowiden audio filter (src/audio/stereowiden.ts)

src/audio/stereowiden.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_stereowiden.c: the
delay, feedback, crossfeed and drymix option table with its ranges and
defaults, the packed float stereo format and layout list (query_formats), the
ring length 2*lrintf(delay*sample_rate/1000) and its EINVAL for a zero-length
ring (config_input), and the delayed cross-feed loop with its ring of previous
input samples in native read/write order (filter_frame).

